  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The application fails to provide any information to demonstrate how the proposed development would achieve the statutory minimum 10% Biodiversity Net Gain (BNG), as required by the Environment Act 2021. In the absence of this information, the Local Planning Authority cannot be satisfied that the development would not result in a net loss of biodiversity or that it would deliver the required net gain. The proposal is therefore contrary to Policies G6 of the London Plan (2021), CS1 of the Harrow Core Strategy (2012) and DM20 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013).&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;By reasons of the adverse vertical stacking issue between Bedroom 3 in Flat 1 and the dining room in Flat 2&amp;nbsp; and the lack of an adequately sized living/kitchen/dining area for Flat 1, would cumulatively result in sub-standard level of living accommodation for the future occupiers of the proposed flats. The proposal is therefore contrary to Policies D6 and D14 of the London Plan (2021), CS1 of the Harrow Core Strategy (2012) and DM1 and DM26 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013), the Residential Design Guide (2010) and Housing Design Standards London Plan Guidance (2023).&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
